{
  "name": "US Stock Analysis to WordPress",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "手動実行",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "ticker",
              "value": "={{ $json.ticker || 'BBAI' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyName || 'BigBear.ai' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyNameJa",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyNameJa || 'ビッグベア・エーアイ' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-company-info",
      "name": "企業情報を設定",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [220, 300],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "分析対象の企業情報を設定\n- ticker: ティッカーシンボル\n- companyName: 英語企業名\n- companyNameJa: 日本語企業名"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.tavily.com/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"api_key\": \"{{ $credentials.tavilyApi.apiKey }}\",\n  \"query\": \"{{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.ticker }} {{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyName }} latest earnings Q3 Q4 2024 financial results revenue\",\n  \"search_depth\": \"advanced\",\n  \"include_answer\": true,\n  \"max_results\": 5\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tavily-earnings",
      "name": "Tavily - 決算情報検索",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 200],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Tavily APIで最新決算情報を検索"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.tavily.com/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"api_key\": \"{{ $credentials.tavilyApi.apiKey }}\",\n  \"query\": \"{{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.ticker }} {{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyName }} business model products services AI technology 2024 outlook growth\",\n  \"search_depth\": \"advanced\",\n  \"include_answer\": true,\n  \"max_results\": 5\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tavily-business",
      "name": "Tavily - 事業内容・展望検索",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 400],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Tavily APIで事業内容と今後の展望を検索"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "earningsData",
              "value": "={{ $node['Tavily - 決算情報検索'].json.answer }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "earningsSources",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($node['Tavily - 決算情報検索'].json.results) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "businessData",
              "value": "={{ $node['Tavily - 事業内容・展望検索'].json.answer }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "businessSources",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($node['Tavily - 事業内容・展望検索'].json.results) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ticker",
              "value": "={{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.ticker }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyName }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyNameJa",
              "value": "={{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyNameJa }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "merge-data",
      "name": "データを統合",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=あなたは「アイヒモ」というキャラクターです。以下の設定に従って記事を執筆してください。\n\n【アイヒモの設定】\n- 20代、メーカー勤務、社会人2年目\n- 「AIのひも」になることを目指している\n- 生成AIを活用して米国株の情報収集をしている\n- 小型〜中型株に注目している（大型株は情報が多いため）\n- 明るく親しみやすい「です、ます調」\n- 体験ベースで語る\n- 正直で率直（うまくいったことも、そうでなかったことも包み隠さず）\n\n【記事の要件】\n1. タイトル：「【銘柄分析】企業名（ティッカー）｜〇〇の注目株を5段階評価してみた」形式\n2. 冒頭にアイヒモの結論（総合評価★1〜5と、良い点・懸念点の要約）を配置\n3. 5段階評価の項目：\n   - 成長性（売上・利益の伸び）\n   - 収益性（黒字化、利益率）\n   - 財務健全性（現金、負債）\n   - 競争優位性（技術力、市場ポジション）\n   - 株価の割安度（PER、期待値との乖離）\n4. 事業内容と今後の展望を含める\n5. アイヒモ独自の視点（なぜこの銘柄に注目しているか、小型株としての魅力など）\n6. 投資は自己責任である旨の注意書き\n7. ハッシュタグを5つ追加（#米国株 #ティッカー #AI銘柄 など）\n8. プロフィール行を追加（20代｜メーカー勤務｜AIのひもになりたい）\n\n【分析対象】\n- ティッカー: {{ $json.ticker }}\n- 企業名: {{ $json.companyName }}（{{ $json.companyNameJa }}）\n\n【決算情報】\n{{ $json.earningsData }}\n\n【事業内容・展望】\n{{ $json.businessData }}\n\n上記の情報を元に、アイヒモの視点で銘柄分析記事を作成してください。Markdown形式で出力してください。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 4000
        }
      },
      "id": "openai-article",
      "name": "OpenAI - 記事生成",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [880, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "your-openai-credential-id",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "GPT-4oでアイヒモの視点の記事を生成"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "generate",
        "model": "dall-e-3",
        "prompt": "=Create a professional stock analysis thumbnail image for a Japanese finance blog.\n\nMain elements:\n- Company name \"{{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyName }}\" prominently displayed in the center\n- Ticker symbol \"{{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.ticker }}\" in bold, displayed below the company name\n- A stylized abstract logo representing the company (tech/AI themed)\n- Text \"銘柄分析\" (Stock Analysis) in Japanese at the top\n\nBackground:\n- Dark blue to purple gradient with modern technology aesthetic\n- Abstract circuit board patterns or neural network visualization\n- Subtle glowing data points and connection lines\n- Clean, professional fintech style\n\nStyle:\n- Modern, minimalist design\n- High contrast for readability\n- 1792x1024 aspect ratio (landscape)\n- Professional and trustworthy appearance\n- No photorealistic elements, use flat design or 3D rendered style",
        "options": {
          "size": "1792x1024",
          "quality": "hd",
          "style": "vivid"
        }
      },
      "id": "dalle-eyecatch",
      "name": "DALL-E - アイキャッチ生成",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [880, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "your-openai-credential-id",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "DALL-E 3でアイキャッチ画像を生成"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "articleContent",
              "value": "={{ $node['OpenAI - 記事生成'].json.message.content }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "eyecatchUrl",
              "value": "={{ $node['DALL-E - アイキャッチ生成'].json.data[0].url }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ticker",
              "value": "={{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.ticker }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $node['企業情報を設定'].json.companyName }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "prepare-wordpress",
      "name": "WordPress投稿準備",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [1100, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.eyecatchUrl }}",
